2. The Licensee retains all rights in the Licensee Materials and grants the Licensor a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use them to the extent necessary to perform the Main Agreement.
3. Third-Party Components are governed by the licenses of their owners. This License does not limit rights arising under those licenses.
4. Economic copyrights in the Software pass to the Licensee only under an express provision of the Main Agreement and after full payment of the fee.
5. The Licensor reserves the right to be credited as the author (e.g. a “Created by WaveZ Studio” footer), unless the Main Agreement provides otherwise.
6. The Licensor retains the right to use its knowledge, experience, general techniques and its own reusable tools and libraries (know-how), including in projects for other clients.

## § 3. Grant of License

1. Upon payment of the fee due, the Licensor grants the Licensee a **non-exclusive, non-transferable, perpetual** license (unless the Main Agreement provides otherwise) to use the Software.
2. The license covers the following fields of exploitation:
